cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Relation extraction over a gut microbiome corpus
message: >-
  This dataset is unvalidated model output. If you use it, please contact the
  author first so that its validation status is represented accurately.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Oumaima
    family-names: TODO
    affiliation: LS2N, Nantes Universite
    orcid: TODO
abstract: >-
  Model-predicted relations between six entity types (Species, Disease,
  Chemical, Gene, CellLine, Mutation) extracted from the full text of 52
  open-access gut microbiome articles. 8436 relations over 2786 sentences.
  No gold standard has been produced and no precision or recall figures are
  available.
keywords:
  - relation extraction
  - biomedical natural language processing
  - gut microbiome
  - information extraction
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-07
